{"summary":"Embark with Lara Croft on an epic turn-based puzzle-adventure.","description":"Lara Croft GO is a turn-based puzzle experience that blends elegant design with satisfying challenge. Each level is a handcrafted puzzle that rewards logic, planning, all presented in a beautifully minimalist world inspired by ancient ruins.\n\nFeatures:\n🧠 Over 115 puzzles across 7 chapters crafted to test your logic without overwhelming you.\n\n⌛ Turn-based gameplay that gives you time to plan each move.\n\n🎮 Simple swipe-to-move interface designed for mobile play.\n\n🧩 Optional challenges and relics store hidden secrets for players seeking extra depth.\n\n🎨 Art and ambient soundtrack create a calm, focused puzzle environment.\n\n🕹️  Optional hints and outfits are available to make the game more enjoyable.\n\nLara Croft GO is designed for players who appreciate thoughtful puzzles and a polished, distraction-free experience.\n\nEnd User License Agreement:\nhttp://eu.square-enix.com/en/documents/LaraCroftGO-EULA-index\n\nUncover secrets, solve ancient puzzles, and immerse yourself in a mysterious world with nostalgic visuals and calm atmosphere. Download now and start your journey!","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence, Fear","iapPrices":"$1.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4oI3Equ8074?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JK0tXxp9nojbLag87Q98AcKiEwkOOUgU1ngRXO6bcvwGzSpvLzyrvIU8PoJt6X-rdXENtxh20j07JjBFojIwyw","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Hu0qJtVwbOawnFjHmG7sEROAWuUGL9YbF6mD_iySUM5yBW9OOITvSusdjd_9GZvJZi1osug2wH_oC9EawgURlQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/paDfw7XLSvkKaPqs8vih5SlPjaRAugbK8ix6ytEMmDdnzGqm3kDEBSYhLBzzmnUsrSx9-1TKbA2oUYC880oM","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/T-zZp7reWzXRA84qrTgmCRGVaBp156lGJMnHuHIDo4OlXb2laJlbTVM4Ss7tOUj0wpBdjEAURpRTXqzmuHXz","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mrEzq4EC5Yd9uifNY3wFKkRnLv524_Ef8qd42pSF-xuuH849eSStSNKWU0A